  "body": "__Added ARM64 support. (Backup recommended)__\r\n- ARM64版を作ってみました。ただARM版Windowsを持っていないのでテストできていません。\r\nARM版Windowsをお持ちの方は、[tearm_260611.zip](https://github.com/tablacus/TablacusExplorer/releases/download/26.6.11/tearm_260611.zip) をダウンロードして既存の環境に上書きし、`TEARM64.exe` を実行してみてください。\r\nフィードバックをいただけると助かります。正常に動作したか、問題が発生したかをぜひ教えてください。\r\n- Added an ARM64 build. However, I do not have a Windows ARM device, so I have not been able to test it.\r\nIf you have a Windows ARM device, please download [tearm_260611.zip](https://github.com/tablacus/TablacusExplorer/releases/download/26.6.11/tearm_260611.zip), extract it over your existing installation, and run `TEARM64.exe`.\r\nFeedback would be greatly appreciated. Please let me know whether it works correctly or if you encounter any issues.\r\n\r\n[VirusToatl](https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b55e6384b3cbb8495c893606867d0f4e17b306c03f7b4cc30b13c279b35ab29e?nocache=1)\r\n[VirusToatl(ARM64)](https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9462b711d56042dba66227532aa9d2031ecd67acc2c2ca856ada22eae37576d5?nocache=1)",

